  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere (Energy Beam (blast shape)), caster level 10th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you shift an Energy Beam, you can spend 1 spell point as a free action to instead choose to focus the beam itself, keeping it in place and making it difficult for those affected by it to move from the area. All creatures who begin their turn within the Energy Beam must succeed at a Fortitude saving throw or be unable to move until the beginning of their next turn. On a successful save, the creature becomes immune to subsequent uses of your focused Energy Beam for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc30\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
